{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_title", "source_sha256": "6edff9abbca4ff4196d67a3de062ee32da0cfc92fe0f0557e4f09b31838ab16c", "ja": "その背中の翼には", "zh": "在那背后的羽翼上", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_synopsis", "source_sha256": "6e9f40ff3c0b6a55768d7e1f126e6643d9ee8970ba0b6d2948c82644923d21d9", "ja": "かつて自分がスカウトされたイベントに出演\nする事になった翼は、そこで翼に憧れている\nという年下の少女と出会う。自身が追われる\n立場になった事を知って初めは戸惑うが、\n前を走り続ける事を告げ、ステージに立つ。", "zh": "翼决定出演自己曾经被星探发掘的活动，\n并在那里遇到了崇拜自己的年幼少女。\n得知自己成了被人追赶的立场，起初虽然有些困惑，\n但她告诉对方自己会继续在前面奔跑，并登上了舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1000_p", "source_sha256": "bcf9b45834585cb58c535f8df73b214901c1201277132239cbbac3272c4695b8", "ja": "（今日は、例のファッション誌主催イベント、\nその出演者達の顔合わせ兼ミーティングだ）", "zh": "（今天是那个时尚杂志主办的活动，\n是和参加活动的各位见面兼开会。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1001_kokoseimodel", "source_sha256": "afe71ff11590f61a7669056440bea3a9524ecf7dbbe0824025dcc77f789e94b5", "ja": "ヒナノです！　高校1年生で、『Girls High』の\n専属モデルやってます。よろしくお願いしま～す♪", "zh": "我是Hinano！现在是高中1年级学生，担任《Girls High》的专属模特。请多关照～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1002_p", "source_sha256": "c07f7a578abd397d66b10a5a4728abe57185893057ca3d191ccac48dd3ccf167", "ja": "（まずは、出演者達の自己紹介から。\nそれにしても……）", "zh": "（首先从出演者们的自我介绍开始。话说回来……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "3cf4b4d2182751eb3861eec94a088c2d743dd38c212481b0a350dc731f937271", "ja": "よろしくお願いします！　みんなモデルだけあって\nメッチャかわいいな～……足細いし、背も高いし……。", "zh": "请多关照！大家不愧是模特，真的超级可爱啊～……腿又细，个子又高……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1004_p", "source_sha256": "69b47e2bd9d2ab4172a724b6d3f8f11422b1c1aa0e2d42c387da7b14811d685f", "ja": "ほとんどの子が読者モデルらしいけど、\n流石という感じだな……。", "zh": "听说其中大多数都是读者模特，果然名不虚传啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1005_p", "source_sha256": "32b537a0e9496de535a6c4afe5460710c36f73b67626d8a5f071922d6a9c01a7", "ja": "次は、ローティーン向けの雑誌\n『Girls Sweet』のモデルの子達だな。", "zh": "接下来是面向低年龄段少女的杂志《Girls Sweet》的模特们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1006_null", "source_sha256": "7d525ab3b093feb9cfc8036c308137aa0a670f93f42e0734cfcfb908ba85b0c6", "ja": "はじめまして！　『Girls Sweet』のモデルを\nしています、ナナセです。中学1年生ですっ。", "zh": "初次见面！我是担任《Girls Sweet》模特的七濑。\n现在上初中1年级。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1007_nanase", "source_sha256": "03517eebbc4485dd51b0c60015e07137b3329038d775fa2e60158741ba048531", "ja": "あ、あのっ。私、えっと……。", "zh": "啊，那个……我，我……呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1009_nanase", "source_sha256": "efb495c8611bdbb79793f2822f4791b97c6c840c34a589c2232b20f91ae5f309", "ja": "つ、翼ちゃんに憧れてて……！\nだから、そのっ。よ、よろしくお願いしますっ！", "zh": "我、我一直很憧憬翼……！\n所以，那个……请、请多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8b0198e40c38d0dd1071fdef5e1858dec363adad41257b582dda359af19d71ad", "ja": "……え？\n翼って……もしかして、わたしのこと？", "zh": "……诶？\n翼……难道说，是指我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "58a75b8cdf84167c76b77bcf5f1a3e748a4bb21225ddb56be23a6a8f56705109", "ja": "へー、翼が好きなんだ。じゃあもしかして、\nアイドルになりたいとか？", "zh": "诶——，原来你喜欢翼啊。那你该不会是想成为偶像吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1012_nanase", "source_sha256": "db29c1dd9c87bebb68616f48ec7d0b82f278e1b7905d17fc6958d591f47ac5fc", "ja": "は、はい！　アイドルになりたいです！　翼ちゃん、\nこのショーでスカウトされたって聞いたし……。", "zh": "是、是的！我想成为偶像！我听说翼就是在这场演出中被发掘的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1013_nanase", "source_sha256": "e73e9121cfbbd90a0e247c8c53037bf352ac155e968f9eb28c0fe97d36897d90", "ja": "なので私も……アイドル、目指してますっ！", "zh": "所以我也……正以成为偶像为目标！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "11fefa91c1a792ebe23eb4702f9e05a575e5674349f1415a8a9af2e848fb1dcc", "ja": "あの、翼ちゃん……？", "zh": "那个，翼……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0a33d0cdefe87ea40e4f1a37116ddc3adc00104992343bffaaeb8d5318db3f3c", "ja": "翼、何か言わなくていいのか？", "zh": "翼，你不说点什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e54d8397f348338edac15d65f7157f1d40082356b549142560169940a5d6d182", "ja": "え？\nあ、えっとー……。", "zh": "诶？\n啊，那个——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f353a50d8c1173321bb410176818b2dddb3724e6c4e8a501c27b6b7d08e5e09f", "ja": "……がんばってね？", "zh": "……要加油哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1019_nanase", "source_sha256": "342b98c02b25c942722c329c0179a4fdbf2447eb2bd6cb832392ae4c998b79f7", "ja": "は、はい！　がんばります……！", "zh": "好、好的！我会努力的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1020_modeltachi", "source_sha256": "ce201a8b40e8037cb510e002822364b34ecba2e90492b0361caf020942955609", "ja": "クスクス……", "zh": "呵呵呵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "336fec5c981f713abf9f10e06dc079a87c694a87722717a02317fb6e30b24569", "ja": "（あ、あれ？　なんか、みんな笑ってる……\nわたし、変なこと言っちゃったのかな……）", "zh": "（啊、咦？总觉得大家都在笑……\n是不是我说了什么奇怪的话……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1022_016tsu", "source_sha256": "500140ebae518bd6adce105243e2d2c0899b062eb4aa84ae194c3f98ac7e7c72", "ja": "（どうしよう……{$P$}さん！）", "zh": "（怎么办……{$P$}先生！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1024_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2d2eb036af92e53d566934d21c22d76ad3edfa4d187e1bd75f240a817339413b", "ja": "（ほっ……）", "zh": "（呼……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1025_director", "source_sha256": "761a01ad6455d9f3cfb23bd5e85edb4db2a12089640dfc82fead8b109d43b9c9", "ja": "それでは自己紹介も終わったところで、\nイベントの説明に移りたいと思います。", "zh": "自我介绍也结束了，接下来开始说明活动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1026_director", "source_sha256": "d0737b510dfda0be82d8cb926cf107397c6de3f536c627e964fc99048a109048", "ja": "みなさん、お手元の資料をご覧ください。", "zh": "请大家查看手头的资料。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1028_p", "source_sha256": "8ae8352ca1a6b2e61898024b1c4de25168b43d969148665464c78209883bc1ba", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様。後は、ショー当日に着る\n衣装の合わせや、リハーサルがあるけど……。", "zh": "大家辛苦了。之后虽然还有时装秀当天要穿的\n服装试穿和彩排……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1029_p", "source_sha256": "ee13f264c0c20bc50d42394e2990dd803eb6416fe527ae0bfeed2a64fd93d788", "ja": "今日のところは、これで終了だ。\n引き続き、よろしく頼んだ！", "zh": "今天就先到这里。\n接下来也拜托大家了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1030_012mam", "source_sha256": "9aaa6dd7727d59e766dbe6923035c8d8c5b142543ee40a0d9751e16ced12b54e", "ja": "いやぁ～、まさかこんなところにバサバサのファンが\nいるとは！　にくいですなぁ～、このこの！", "zh": "哎呀～真没想到这种地方居然也有巴萨巴萨的粉丝！\n真有你的呀～你这家伙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1031_037nao", "source_sha256": "8eeec23df99480f4dc775fe1daaaf27346ff0f502e5ee987c8cf322dd9cdd99a", "ja": "そういえば翼、あの時メッチャ固まっとったな？\nなんでなん？", "zh": "对了，翼，你当时整个人都愣住了吧？为什么呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1032_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2cb2f133ab4f4e119c2a2be301ee482de50aefd995eb87b5914d007247b0c68d", "ja": "だって、わたしに憧れてるとか。そんなこと\n初めて言われたから、びっくりしちゃって……。", "zh": "因为有人说憧憬着我什么的……这种话还是第一次听到，所以吓了一跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1033_020meg", "source_sha256": "24ab53878f2d6389ea7d2c32c5d8f57c19803fcf6b142a33dc459cd4b7d3fbb2", "ja": "あ～……。\nあの子、中1って言ってたっけ？", "zh": "啊～……\n那孩子，之前是说自己上初1来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1034_005yay", "source_sha256": "846ecda6363215abdf7998548aa8f177259a20b36d2b1634aee3404d1f864260", "ja": "私と翼ちゃんより、ひとつ年下ですね！\n一生懸命で、なんだかかわいかったかも。", "zh": "比我和翼小一岁呢！\n她非常努力，感觉还挺可爱的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1035_012mam", "source_sha256": "7cc3efe7f6a43d044dee300484ad844ab350b8d31dfe0e574ec2364658c364ab", "ja": "そうそう！　1歳違うと、\n中学と高校にだって分かれるかんね！", "zh": "没错没错！要是相差1岁的话，就会一个上初中、一个上高中啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1036_012mam", "source_sha256": "f15e52d000829558ef36d0dc0ba1ec9225dedf77cb58aca8dae2f44ab0f96ceb", "ja": "兄ちゃん君には、そういう乙女ゴコロのサビを\n理解してほしいもんですな～。", "zh": "哥哥你啊，真希望你能理解这种少女心的微妙之处呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1037_p", "source_sha256": "07d707328bac8126c2f45964c68c91e7596f4675f27b3f0fefc182c8a9b4ba42", "ja": "乙女心の……機微か？\nそうだな、肝に銘じておくよ。", "zh": "是少女心的……微妙之处吗？\n这样啊，我会牢记在心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1039_p", "source_sha256": "76a7998307115993ae11b643c2cfb789d61c70d012c50f028a124b4bfb5de443", "ja": "（打ち合わせが終わり、解散した。\n翼は、この後何もないはずだけど……）", "zh": "（商量结束后，大家就解散了。\n翼之后应该没什么安排，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1040_p", "source_sha256": "5115747f8556069865111944305f1c36dbf68065397d06174342e20a419d15da", "ja": "翼、ちょっといいか？\n時間があるなら、新曲の話を……。", "zh": "翼，方便聊一下吗？要是你有时间的话，关于新歌……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1042_p", "source_sha256": "e0f37b010e517eb3195dfe542122de8b56dfde0b83ad3294291a2a049887cd2a", "ja": "翼？", "zh": "翼？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1043_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b89496a3664d9af299d4f35f24e7446d649492a898bdc8e0bc58a59083c6d676", "ja": "あっ……あれ、{$P$}さん？\n今、何か言いましたか？", "zh": "啊……咦，{$P$}先生？\n刚才是说了什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1044_p", "source_sha256": "42a6b3591e8769f801f00b0f32f90969e8b3beab389d8f827c1a441fec5a4275", "ja": "ああ。翼はこの後、仕事もレッスンもなかったよな。\n時間があるなら、ちょっといいか？", "zh": "啊。翼之后没有工作或练习了吧。\n有时间的话，能占用你一会儿吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1045_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4765a6bf753211dd227e305869fe74db31c88b0679bc1344a911fb550cda86f3", "ja": "あっ……はい。\n……。", "zh": "啊……好。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1046_p", "source_sha256": "04a1408639e315333ca77fc9790d0367292c3c90d5e7de292d8d3095344f1e5e", "ja": "今日はお疲れ。\n……打ち合わせが終わってから、上の空だな？", "zh": "今天辛苦了。\n……你从刚才开始就一直心不在焉的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1047_016tsu", "source_sha256": "e9b7178653400f17b423819eb1bd5502a41dd951486760af52a656b9a262d786", "ja": "うーん……わたし、さっきからずっと、\n考えてるんですけど。なんか、うまくまとまらなくて。", "zh": "嗯……我从刚才开始就一直在想，可总觉得怎么都理不清。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1048_p", "source_sha256": "f3c20a9d6dd3f7a7f8fdc19cdf5e0f38531981274f78991b035d5c45f9411c5f", "ja": "考えてる……\nさっきの、ナナセって子の事か？", "zh": "在想事情……\n是在想刚才那个叫七濑的孩子吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1049_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c5f14cf495153803976680f9cd82ad088d82c07fc71f66768a9ff8c449ba825c", "ja": "えっ。{$P$}さん、\nどうしてわかったの？", "zh": "诶，{$P$}先生，你怎么知道的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1050_p", "source_sha256": "d10188b58d157d73c4038b01eb96dc31b6e3005030e72cfcaaafb07c4befc5c6", "ja": "そりゃあ、翼のプロデューサーだからな。\nそれで、翼はあの子の何がそんなに気になるんだ？", "zh": "那当然，因为我是翼的制作人嘛。\n话说回来，翼到底为什么那么在意那孩子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1051_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5bce44e5a27830606395f5ceb6cd180db78ba02586cadfc2e683043aeaba38ae", "ja": "うーん。\n……なんでわたしなのかな？って。", "zh": "嗯……\n……为什么会是我呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1052_016tsu", "source_sha256": "edc9cc67d03fa3683a76a37e46c77a87e3c47656e4eacf5002cf2707e4204908", "ja": "だって、アイドルっていっぱいいるじゃないですか。\nわたしより売れてる人もいっぱいいるし。", "zh": "因为偶像有那么多嘛。\n比我走红的人也有很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1053_016tsu", "source_sha256": "61e0291ab77ba9c713a47f2815f5c53411ab30a371a2653f638808d2eb7af660", "ja": "わたしも、最近はけっこうがんばってますけど。\nでも美希先輩とかに比べたら、全然だし……。", "zh": "我也觉得最近自己挺努力的啦。\n可是比起美希前辈她们，就根本还差得远……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1054_p", "source_sha256": "e2bfff893769a495fbf73e77455053d204847ac5ea677a593382dd9a8c300d1b", "ja": "それはやっぱり、あの子の好きなアイドルが\n翼だからじゃないか？", "zh": "果然还是因为那孩子喜欢的偶像是翼吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1055_p", "source_sha256": "a72506a445746bc96feb3cea5a341491da45745adcc8bb8f95a3226cbe3a944d", "ja": "翼が美希を好きなのと、同じだと思うよ。", "zh": "就和翼喜欢美希是一样的道理。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1056_016tsu", "source_sha256": "21644782a0caf4fc40d58ed7f34867ca7fc9903cc1f633676da8a1b247502f46", "ja": "えー。でも～……。", "zh": "诶——可是～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1057_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8f90195f2f1645432d1a2a4d5dd7d0cb1219990df5293cc13e42e97d9b8c74bd", "ja": "やっぱり、わかんないよー！　だってわたし、\nわたしより美希先輩のほうが絶対すごいって思うし！", "zh": "还是搞不懂啦——！因为我觉得，\n美希前辈绝对比我要厉害得多啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1058_016tsu", "source_sha256": "421662dc05331cfab7e81ccbc6c23827dbf01d8aa5486567274312d2fadb2918", "ja": "わたしよりすごい人がたくさんいるのに、\nなんであの子は、わたしなんだろう……？", "zh": "明明比我厉害的人有那么多，\n为什么那个女孩子偏偏会选我呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1059_p", "source_sha256": "9f56438cfb820e2f01fcbdc7998d750820dffc78d140d8c76b3ef98afccc11b4", "ja": "なんで翼なのか、か。\nそれはあの子にしかわからない事だけど……。", "zh": "你是说，为什么会是翼吗？这只有她自己才知道……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1060_p", "source_sha256": "2a18f66fb7014a0c05a1dfd8c8297550928702af1a0e384fb801eef6e4d30491", "ja": "いや……もしかしたら、\n本人にもわからない事かもしれないな。", "zh": "不……说不定，\n连她本人也不清楚呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1061_016tsu", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1062_p", "source_sha256": "8ec920a62661084a06c5e3da7c27921215a80021ca65b656bed4130801ac55ea", "ja": "ひとつだけ言えるのは、あの子から見た翼は、\n『本物のアイドル』だって事かな。", "zh": "能说的只有一点，那就是在那孩子眼中，翼是“真正的偶像”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1063_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3fabac7589d614f74aef3dcaf8dbc14884d3867d9791b238d5baf501df2e2cd3", "ja": "本物のアイドル……？", "zh": "真正的偶像……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1064_p", "source_sha256": "8f7c3df8b8c86bcbc4ab602ac1cb123ee6799709dbac5ea2ceee7c3d03734c97", "ja": "ああ。あの子にとって、翼は本物のアイドルで、\nあの子が今目指している世界の先輩だ。", "zh": "是啊。对那个孩子来说，翼是真正的偶像，也是她如今所憧憬的世界里的前辈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1065_p", "source_sha256": "7fb53a30c749d4d7e0ee1ce495626dc07d3937e145ed02b1faffd37e1928382b", "ja": "美希に憧れてアイドルを続けている翼が、\n今度は憧れられる存在になったんだ。すごい事だよ。", "zh": "受到美希憧憬、一直坚持做偶像的翼，如今也成为了别人憧憬的对象。真是了不起啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1066_016tsu", "source_sha256": "29a96265cef89408ea514ec1d70a728d6be500974933bb11316b213c35bee8c2", "ja": "先輩……わたしが……？\n……。", "zh": "前辈……我……？\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1067_016tsu", "source_sha256": "10f1d6c9a51e8b3280a877e1f93c7c268271f89865ed21d6def9c5d01e2cba5b", "ja": "……{$P$}さん！！", "zh": "……{$P$}先生！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1068_016tsu", "source_sha256": "7ce3ebe06d3261b14a4b427a2f9c8230dad8bf0f17875539c7e958c0fd990c69", "ja": "なんか、いま急に！　肩のトコがずしーって、\n重くなったカンジがする！　どうして！？", "zh": "总觉得，就在刚才突然！肩膀这儿一下子变得沉甸甸的，有种变重了的感觉！怎么回事！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1069_p", "source_sha256": "6d4472c101bb729e9836451778b6ade0d9842f51ce76886883659d48cdcbf05b", "ja": "はは、そうか。……翼なりに、重圧というか……\n責任みたいなものを感じたんだな。", "zh": "哈哈，这样啊。……看来翼也感受到了某种压力，或者说……责任吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1070_016tsu", "source_sha256": "793de1d14dbefdfbcb32aed08b9d663f503e1268cf36827d0e2edfbf0d1140c8", "ja": "責任？", "zh": "责任？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1071_p", "source_sha256": "7700e53a2dd96c53792c07c95eade7888b1a529135399af3d3b4e41330d1d3b0", "ja": "翼はいつも、何かに憧れて、追いかけているよな。\nその強い想いは、前に進むための大事な力だと思う。", "zh": "翼总是在憧憬着什么，并不断追逐着它呢。那份强烈的心愿，我觉得是让自己不断前进的重要力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1072_p", "source_sha256": "6b3a7484cd2ae9f00176a6bdf4f8d93c5f0ed1dfc52573941293cae94e70ac50", "ja": "でも、そうだな。誰かの目標になって\n追いかけられる事も、いい経験になるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "不过，怎么说呢。成为别人的目标，被别人追赶，也会是一段不错的经历吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1073_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c51a38f288161cb334b662577fcaa8d465ec2948a5ed96c21afd7e55bb054d43", "ja": "追いかけられる……わたしが？", "zh": "被人追赶……我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1074_p", "source_sha256": "3744c9d2818d1aacedf24c41aa2b5957c52ff4a243a1e42de01f464e3ade40ba", "ja": "ああ。翼が美希を追いかけるのと同じ熱量で、\nあの子や誰かが、翼を追いかけてくる……。", "zh": "是啊。会有那孩子，或是其他什么人，以翼追逐美希时同样的热情，追逐着翼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1076_p", "source_sha256": "4209fc6fc4c0b02cdd6ba06ac44c6e2227f1d7d98b4cf40aa37c6d18e85f6a5b", "ja": "でもその怖さは、美希や響や……先輩である\n他のみんなが、常に感じているものでもあるんだ。", "zh": "但这种害怕，也是美希、响……以及作为前辈的其他大家一直都在感受到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1077_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3a3a6104d6f7330f2a68f31ca00172e8b7de42d8e4f210b265e5ae62d1d6b388", "ja": "{$P$}さん……わたし……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1078_016tsu", "source_sha256": "aa00d19cb9b2944db622d34ee5a4961448a0f9bb736c440142d4085922d9e5fb", "ja": "追いかけられたら、わたし……\n今よりもっと成長して……それで……。", "zh": "要是被追上的话，我……就会比现在成长得更加出色……然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1079_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2db2c9414e0143e3e3f94a1ea5b5969f53be4305887ab158fbb475657ff8987d", "ja": "もっともっと、大人で……\n今よりも、すごいアイドルになれる……？", "zh": "变得更加、更加成熟……\n成为比现在更厉害的偶像吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1080_p", "source_sha256": "6f27b2504415daac64f8ab9cc9b6ce1305485809b535b7093862e5f49caaa196", "ja": "ああ。翼ならなれる。\nそう思うよ。", "zh": "嗯。只要是翼，就一定能做到。\n我是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1082_p", "source_sha256": "a79c0aecf7a0ff1d18509090392ef32387afb125642b33c4ea3eedac7d570772", "ja": "（翼はまだ14歳。追いかけられる側になるには、\n少し早いのかもしれないが……）", "zh": "（翼还只有14岁。要成为被人追逐的一方，或许还稍微早了点……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1083_p", "source_sha256": "29d8f37f9b137a72e5ac7f86269d07048d636bec6dbb17da9f01ba1e5d6c4ee0", "ja": "（それでも、翼なら行けるはずだ。追いかけられる側に\nなるのは、強い輝きを放つ者の証明なのだから）", "zh": "即便如此，翼一定能做到。因为成为被人追赶的那一方，正是散发出强烈光芒之人的证明。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1084_null", "source_sha256": "8024a9fcac40dade22120ae9fa3d5437befebe12b4cd510f04aa6399dc2ce31c", "ja": "本番当日……", "zh": "正式演出当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1085_nanase", "source_sha256": "1a600da575765f42b8c2a152a8a31f992eec66d298c5ce5e945daca6c8f6e231", "ja": "つ、翼ちゃん、おはようございます！\n今日は、よろしくお願いします！", "zh": "翼、翼，早上好！  \n今天也请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1086_016tsu", "source_sha256": "22066d8b950e9a4f911cfc9dbee40de4fbb0b740eded20d74d467e21313f5f5b", "ja": "あ、うん。おはよう。\n……。", "zh": "啊，嗯。早上好。\n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1087_nanase", "source_sha256": "0acf4552e03a62102b66029de134b303030736620d88ddf2bd2f8eac61826016", "ja": "あの、えっと……す、ステージ、頑張ってください！\nそれじゃあ……！", "zh": "那个，呃……舞、舞台表演，请加油！\n那么……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1088_016tsu", "source_sha256": "193a37a126bd5d9ccdbdb29a7e3d46d3f615d4c478bb25cf19e97368f55b6e06", "ja": "あ、ナナセちゃん……だっけ。\nちょっと待って。", "zh": "啊，叫七濑……对吧。\n等一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1089_nanase", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1090_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3d99317b9bc2afa766d569284e58575825b2afb51b5974f5f0c09f689686217d", "ja": "……えっと。この前、すぐに反応できなくて\nごめんね。わたし、驚いちゃって……。", "zh": "……那个，之前没能马上回应你，对不起。我当时吓了一跳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1091_nanase", "source_sha256": "ec6668c5fe37088c056ff8dd03124b55f9a36743482331fd76429e30c5aed8bb", "ja": "い、いえ！　そんな、私の方こそ……。", "zh": "没、没有的事！怎么会，我这边才应该……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1092_016tsu", "source_sha256": "495c0bfc2098f42c00c4591ae8c01a91f355130ea48c6370d0541860e99ad7ff", "ja": "えっと……わたしね。\nいつも誰かのこと、追いかけてばっかりなんだ。", "zh": "那个……我啊。\n总是在不停追赶着某个人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1093_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b85084f8a7a977df46503a9221126a321e486139e2cf74b1f88b8dc144af923e", "ja": "だから自分が誰かに追いかけられるなんて、思っても\nみなくて……でも、うん。なんか、わかったかもって。", "zh": "所以，我从来没想过自己也会被谁追赶……不过，嗯。我好像有点明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1095_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8e3cf8bb2107dcc498d35f15784e446b2da38824ee11536daee016f45910a9ea", "ja": "わたしも、ナナセちゃんと同じだから。\n憧れの人とか、目標とかがあって……。", "zh": "我也和七濑酱一样。\n有憧憬的人，也有想要达到的目标……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1096_016tsu", "source_sha256": "27d8b592c71c19a1a5f3d4a15d6b2f669b6812639a9f7679052564d3e7fbd18f", "ja": "その人たちに追いつきたくて……追い越して、\nもっともっと遠くに行きたいって思ってる。……多分。", "zh": "因为我也想追上那些人……超越他们，去往更加遥远的地方……大概吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1097_016tsu", "source_sha256": "adefefc1aaa51d405ae359e50b4caa55156abec82d2ac9ef3c8baa937e881fb2", "ja": "だからナナセちゃんがわたしを追いかけてきても、\nわたしは気にしないと思うんだ。", "zh": "所以，就算七濑追上来，我想我也不会在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1099_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8b9d1008f598718ddbb0646465064f15077fb67b587b30beef3c875eb70ed03e", "ja": "わたしの追いかけている人たちは、立ち止まったり\nしない。どんどん進んで、突き放しに来る。", "zh": "我正在追赶的那些人，可不会停下脚步。\n他们只会不断前进，想要狠狠甩开我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1100_016tsu", "source_sha256": "be3dfc8d00814c2dc2a92052dc32b8735bd19d5df607e9448487735c7e495e34", "ja": "だからわたしも、待ったりしない。\nこれからも、思いっきり走るよ。", "zh": "所以我也不会停下来等。\n接下来也要拼尽全力奔跑！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1102_016tsu", "source_sha256": "62ed38f3d01b2e80c78f8b67a7d87d48ba0056232c66b27be9cab3e653ae9558", "ja": "……それだけ！\n今日のステージ、見てね！", "zh": "……就这些！\n今天的舞台，要好好看哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1103_nanase", "source_sha256": "8b5447eecd72d02833f651f4921d7c91e89fffeef38597e25571bc4c7aacefbe", "ja": "……！　はいっ！", "zh": "……！好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1104_nanase", "source_sha256": "cea64b772fd04a7f3c5e7aecd3fe3c877f77e3c243a4980d7f1a6f4570dabfdc", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\n今日のステージ、ちゃんと見ますっ……！", "zh": "谢谢你！\n今天的舞台，我一定会好好看的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1105_se", "source_sha256": "cecacb4078a3174484be6e6336f36d7229bdaaa339fe9d97f30dae477d83c4c7", "ja": "タッタッタッ……", "zh": "哒哒哒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1106_016tsu", "source_sha256": "df2cea81d80c32ab9a94bb51b45735df4b05645ab6488f31bfe92cb58cbc24cb", "ja": "……ふう。\nこんな感じで、よかったのかな……？", "zh": "……呼。\n这样就可以了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1107_p", "source_sha256": "f2bb77353cb405c8b947a8b61bb3c4ef334a70baa61086c5fc86f4c86e5aaac4", "ja": "よかったんじゃないか？\n彼女、嬉しそうに見えたよ。", "zh": "这样不就挺好的吗？\n她看起来很开心啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1108_037nao", "source_sha256": "96e01d18abfdbf16547d65926a1d5c33dee4ee61a96f74e4918d325924132f76", "ja": "やるやん、翼！\nメッチャ先輩やったし、カッコ良かったで！", "zh": "干得不错嘛，翼！\n特别有前辈的样子，帅呆了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1109_020meg", "source_sha256": "72c3adab4a9dd96ff899c19f220183747470fc88137c1149c1c5d96158584023", "ja": "うんうん！　翼、いいこと言った！\nあの子、きっと翼のこと、追いかけてくると思うよ。", "zh": "嗯嗯！翼，说得好！\n那个孩子，一定会追随翼的脚步吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1110_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c8dff210e8da787fdecbf84a16671036558b3a68509176ae7141f3855ba08a17", "ja": "そ、そうですか……？　えへへ。\nでも、なんかステージより緊張したかも……。", "zh": "这、这样吗……？　嘿嘿。\n不过，总觉得比上舞台还紧张……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1111_012mam", "source_sha256": "2d4d6eee30971559e11dbf9e47184fda30ca7e76566cfb915f0d1a92f8a27b2f", "ja": "バサバサが緊張してるなんて珍しーね！\n真美が笑わせたげよっか？", "zh": "巴萨巴居然会紧张，真少见呢！\n要不要让真美逗你笑？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1112_005yay", "source_sha256": "3f95e3a321f13e30176fe34508cfc9af886215c1543361df7b73ce7909437c3a", "ja": "真美、イタズラしてる場合じゃないよ。\n私たちも準備しないと！", "zh": "真美，现在可不是恶作剧的时候。\n我们也得准备起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1113_p", "source_sha256": "96813891c80adb95d3e396d76b61d43b95b587b15d1ca986018f6a7d52308e5b", "ja": "そうだな。皆も、着替えて準備が整ったら、\nステージ袖に移動だ。翼、頼んだぞ！", "zh": "没错。大家换好衣服、准备妥当后，就到舞台侧边集合。翼，拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_113_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_113_1114_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2b2d0c9726c62d4794e4484bae319b59c94619fd2d27ffbee8c5119d8b3b601a", "ja": "はーい！", "zh": "是──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
